Source: lh4051-de
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: kuznix-code <noreply@github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               libglib2.0-dev-bin,
               libgtk-4-dev (>= 4.10),
               pkgconf
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/kuznix-code/LH4051-DE
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: lh4051-de
Architecture: any
Depends: lh4051-de-data (= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: labwc
Suggests: appstream
Description: Longhorn 4051-inspired desktop environment
 LH4051-DE is a desktop shell inspired by Windows Longhorn build 4051,
 written in C on top of GTK 4. It provides the desktop, panel, sidebar,
 start menu, file manager, settings and app store, plus a session wrapper
 that starts a compositor and the shell.
 .
 This package contains the desktop shell and its session wrapper.

Package: lh4051-de-updater
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: lh4051-de (= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: LH4051-DE optional updater
 The optional command-line updater downloads and installs supported LH4051-DE
 releases or builds the project from source where supported.

Package: lh4051-de-bootstrap
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: LH4051-DE dependency bootstrap tool
 Optional helper for building GTK 4 and its dependencies from source into a
 chosen installation prefix.

Package: lh4051-de-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Longhorn 4051-inspired desktop environment - data files
 LH4051-DE is a desktop shell inspired by Windows Longhorn build 4051.
 .
 This package contains the architecture-independent data files: the
 application menu entry.

Package: lh4051-de-session
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: lh4051-de (>= ${source:Version}),
         openbox,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Longhorn 4051-inspired desktop environment - X11 session
 LH4051-DE is a desktop shell inspired by Windows Longhorn build 4051.
 .
 This package adds the "LH4051-DE" X11 session entry to the login manager.
 The session runs the shell on top of the default Openbox window manager.

Package: lh4051-de-session-wayland
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: lh4051-de (>= ${source:Version}),
         labwc,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Longhorn 4051-inspired desktop environment - Wayland session
 LH4051-DE is a desktop shell inspired by Windows Longhorn build 4051.
 .
 This package adds the "LH4051-DE (Wayland)" session entry to the login
 manager. The session runs the shell on top of the labwc compositor.

